 you are, maybe she can give you a crash course?<br><br><u>Okay, so now that’s over with -</u><br><br>Some books teach you about morals. Some about sorrow, anger, love, forgiveness, strength.<br><b>This book taught me I’m into vayjay penetration by ✨ s h o t g u n s ✨, being slapped, called slut, and carved with a knife.</b> Amongst other things. <br><br><blockquote>
  <i>"Say that again", he said. "Tell me what you want." <br>"Fuck me up." I smiled. "Just fucking wreck me."</i>
</blockquote><br>Just Juniper having my exact response to Zane<br><br>This girl right here is the coolest and baddest bitch. You know in some books where the MC wants revenge but ends up being "the bigger person😌" and decides to kill them with kindness? You won't see that shit here. Remorse? Doubt? Selflessness? Forget it. <br>And the way Zane and Juniper is the perfect couple?? I'm so jealous tbh<br><br>Let’s be real tho, the most shocking part about this book isn’t the gun or knifeplay, it’s how Juniper goes jogging three days after being half ripped to shreds. <b>That's it, I literally have no excuses left to skip out on the gym</b><br><br>Not gonna say anything else, I know that everyone who loved the first book is gonna read this, and when you have I'm here to fangirl next beside you. <br>And for everyone who gets a little intrigued, I'm pointing you in the direction of Leon and Rae, welcome 💕</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/116193043?shelf=dark-romance" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">dark-romance</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/116193043?shelf=demons" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">demons</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/116193043?shelf=dom-sub-play" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">dom-sub-play</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="