nt__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Her Soul to Take blew my mind when I read it two months ago. To say my expectations were high for Her Soul For Revenge would be an understatement. Laroux absolutely nailed this story to perfection. She had already laid a pretty solid foundation with book 1 and I was one hundred percent invested with these characters and in this paranormal world of hers.<br /><br />In Her Soul For Revenge it’s the survivor Juniper and her journey for revenge the reader follows. She sells her soul to the demon Zane for the purpose of him helping her getting revenge over those people who’s wronged her. <br />There’s a price for making a deal with a demon and Zane has his conditions. He and Juniper were so much fun. Blazing hot chemistry and spectacular sex scenes. I thought the ones in book 1 were amazing but Laroux takes it up a notch. Chef’s kiss! They suited Juniper and Zane’s personality and they had to be dark, bloody and intense. Most important they’re consensual.<br /><br />Her Soul For Revenge is a dark paranormal romance and it’s definitely dark but it’s also emotional. Laroux strips the layers of Juniper and Zane meticulously. Juniper is broken and has endured so much loss and pain. She’s a survivor and a fighter. Living a solitary life until her deal with Zane. Her progress and evolution was sublimely written. How can a demon be vulnerable and show emotions? Zane can and do thanks to Laroux. Zane goes through a change too and I enjoyed his sarcastic remarks, dark dominant side but also him being vulnerable and turning the power over to Juniper in their relationship. These two opposites truly saw each other, was accepting and it was beautiful.<br /><br />With Her Soul For Revenge I can already say that The Souls trilogy is a favorite of mine. <br />This is just dark paranormal romance to perfection. Phenomenal. Whenever I hear the word demon I will always think of a forked pierced tongue. No complaints here.<br /><br />5 Fierce as a Little Wolf Stars<br /><br /><br />*ARC provided by the author*</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/33835029?shelf=arc" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">arc</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/33835029?shelf=dark" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">dark</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/33835029?shelf=dominating-hero" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">dominating-hero</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">36 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">2 comments</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218