er"><span class="Formatted">This rating hurts me a lot and even tho i knew, 𝐈 𝐊𝐍𝐄𝐖 i wasn't gonna loves this as much as 𝐇𝐒𝐓𝐓 because 𝐈 𝐋𝐎𝐕𝐄𝐃 𝐋𝐄𝐎𝐍 so so much. Like a very unhealthy amount especially his relationship with Rae it was just perfect, they were exactly what the other needed and wanted. The kinks and games were my undoing and I'm still looking for 𝐌𝐘 𝐎𝐖𝐍 forked tongue demon btw, but even knowing that i didn't think i would feel like this. I'm really not okay and very much in denial right now..<br><img src="https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1649708636ra/32797872.gif" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br>]|I{•---------⋘⋙---------------•⪼⦕࿅⦖⪻•---------------⋘⋙---------•}I|[<br>Some clarification first, we briefly meet Zane and Juniper in 𝐇𝐒𝐓𝐓 just enough to tease us about this book and frankly 𝐈 𝐀𝐃𝐎𝐑𝐄𝐃 Zane a lot. As in enough to want a threesome between Him, Leon and Rae and that is 𝐒𝐇𝐎𝐂𝐊𝐈𝐍𝐆 coming from me because i deteste random threesome when it's not a 𝐑𝐇 𝐨𝐫 𝐓𝐡𝐫𝐮𝐩𝐥𝐞 situation. But in 𝐇𝐒𝐓𝐓 i really would've loved an 𝐌𝐌𝐅 scene, and maybe it's because Zane and Leon were lovers once upon a time and are still wearing the others mark but i loved the idea. So yeah i really do love me some Demon Zane. <br>Now the reason for my rating, at the end of 𝐇𝐒𝐓𝐓 we know that him and Juniper are a thing and i didn't really like that because 𝐈 𝐃𝐈𝐃𝐍'𝐓 𝐋𝐈𝐊𝐄 𝐇𝐄𝐑. I don't know why or what made me dislike her that much so don't ask me i really don't have an answer for you, but i did and that's why it took me 𝐓𝐇𝐈𝐒 𝐋𝐎𝐍𝐆 to read this. I had to wait until my brain would let go of all the thoughts i had of her so i could enjoy some Sexy Zane Read, and i finally did. I went in this with a clean slate but unfortunately 𝐈 𝐒𝐓𝐈𝐋𝐋 felt the same way about her. Actually it was worse this time because we didn't have her for just two scenes and unfortunately too much of her made her 𝐒𝐎 𝐅#𝐂𝐊𝐈𝐍𝐆 𝐀𝐍𝐍𝐎𝐘𝐈𝐍𝐆 to me. <br><img src="https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1651271391ra/32877943.gif" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br>]|I{•---------⋘⋙---------------•⪼⦕࿅⦖⪻•---------------⋘⋙---------•}I|[<br>Now don't get me wrong the smut and sexy times were 𝐆𝐎𝐋𝐃 𝐀𝐍𝐃 𝐃𝐄𝐋𝐈𝐂𝐈𝐎𝐔𝐒𝐋𝐘 𝐃𝐈𝐑𝐓𝐘 despite my dislike of Juniper. This is 100% it's me, not you situation, so future reader that sees this review dont mind me, give this book a chance. Cause this story 𝐖𝐚𝐬 𝐃𝐚𝐫𝐤, 𝐖𝐢𝐜𝐤𝐞𝐝, 𝐒𝐩𝐢𝐜𝐲, 𝐄𝐫𝐨𝐭𝐢𝐜, 𝐊𝐢𝐧𝐤𝐲, 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐚 𝐥𝐨𝐭 𝐨𝐟 𝐁𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐫, 𝐒𝐚𝐫𝐜𝐚𝐬𝐦 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐁𝐞𝐚𝐮𝐭𝐢𝐟𝐮𝐥 𝐂𝐡𝐞𝐦𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐲 but it didn't hit me as hard as it should have because of my off putting feelings towards Juniper. <br>I applauded and admired Harley Laroux for her boldness when it came to the steamy scenes in 𝐇𝐒𝐓𝐓 and she delivered again in this book. The plot was a bit more developed here and the story was as entertaining as 𝐇𝐒𝐓𝐓 with even more violence, murder and a lot of emotional moments. Even tho the pacing was a bit slower at moment and we did have some repetitive dialogue that irritated me a little, it wouldn't have ruined this story for me if it wasn't already. <br>Zane here proved to me why i loved him so much after only reading two short scenes. He was almost as perfect as my Leon, 𝐇𝐞'𝐬 𝐒𝐞𝐱𝐲, 𝐕𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐨𝐮𝐬, 𝐒𝐚𝐫𝐜𝐚𝐬𝐭𝐢𝐜, 𝐃𝐚𝐫𝐤, 𝐖𝐢𝐭𝐭𝐲 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐌𝐚𝐬𝐨𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐬𝐭 in him called to the Masochist in me. He was amazingly well written and very entertaining but 𝐉𝐮𝐧𝐢𝐩𝐞𝐫 𝐰𝐚𝐬 𝐚 𝐁𝐨𝐮𝐥𝐝𝐞𝐫 𝐝𝐫𝐚𝐠𝐠𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐭𝐡𝐢𝐬 𝐬𝐭𝐨𝐫𝐲 𝐝𝐨𝐰𝐧. Thankfully a certain Archdemon and Witch will be next..<br><img src="https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1641508926ra/32415287.gif" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/114983245?shelf=3-enjoyed-but-sth-was-missing-stars" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">3-enjoyed-but-sth-was-missing-stars</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stat