/span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5933039052">June 18, 2024</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">4.5⭐️ this grabbed me from the beginning. the first few chapters were just insanity in the best way. so enticing. <br /><br />juniper. man this girl is fucking wild. circumstances and survival dictated that but still. wild. i love it. her trauma and perception because of it are so raw and so well done. the tension and anxiety with the knife. it gave me goosebumps. this girl has been running for her life and terrified for <i>years</i> and you can feel it. and the fact that she has finally found a <i>home</i> in a person and place. found comfort and safety and salvation. after all that pain she endured, god she deserved it whether she thought so or not. and the fact that zane is going to tell her until she believes it is amazing. <br /><br />zane is not at all what i imagined. from the snippets of him in her soul to take, i assumed he’d be super laid back and chill and just do was his little wolf wanted because he was so wrapped up in her. nope. he’s fucking insane actually. and i absolutely loved it. he’s almost psychotic in his desire and hunger for pain. his sadomasochistic tendencies are fucked but honestly delicious. and the way they fit so well with juni 😈 we love to see it. but man his love for this girl. i adored it. her took her soul but i think she took his right back. he just understood her so wholly. they’re both so unhinged. in their own ways, her because of circumstance and trauma, him because he’s a demon with only like two fucks to give (one for leon, one for her). <br /><br />i am absolutely loving this plot. the ongoing story and the timeline and how everything is working. i am itching for the last book to find out what the fuck happens but also i don’t want it to end. also just wtf is gonna happen. this is such a great series. the relationship dynamics are clearly very different but i honestly loved this book just as much as the second. i couldn’t pick a favourite and rated the same. just so good. <br /><br /><i>”Fix you? Ah, little wolf, I have no desire to fix you. I just want to see all your broken edges shine. I want to feel how sharp you are.”<br /><br />“I didn't need a rescuer, I didn't need a guardian; he wasn't that. He was my comfort.”<br /><br />“I slaughtered them all, Juniper. Every single one. I promise you right now that nothing that dares try to hurt you gets to live. Nothing.”<br /><br />• paranormal romance<br />• human x demon <br />• revenge plot<br />• age gap 😈<br />• sadomasochism <br />• exhibitionism / voyeurism<br />• bdsm</i></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">26 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">2 comments</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442