4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4296532324">October 21, 2021</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">I am so very thankful Harley sent me a copy of her new title, <b>Her Soul for Revenge</b>. This is what I needed tbh. A Harley book!!! Her romances never let me down and I seriously fall harder and harder for her romance heroes each and every time I finish one of her books. This is the perfect book to read on Halloween at midnight... An horror romance with demons, gore, blood and sex? Sign me up.<br /><br />She's the girl who survived. The girl who was the sacrifice for a God. The girl who ran. Juniper has been running for her life for years, but when she hears the news of her brother's murder, she goes back to that little town that hurt her the most. She has the scars to prove it. Before she goes head to head with the bad guys, with the people who hurt her, she needs help and it comes in the form of a delicious, sexy demon. So, yeah, she sells him her soul for revenge.<br /><br />Revenge, pain, survival— they're all the roots of this novel. They rule Juniper's life in a way that she sees nothing aside from them. She doesn't care about anything but revenge and her anger. And I wanted that for her. I wanted to get everything she wanted in the world, I wanted her to murder everyone who wronged her and who hurt her and who tried to eliminate her. Juniper is a force to be reckoned with!!!! I loved her with my whole heart and I love more her murder-y ways. <br /><br />But the way she finds her other half in someone just as murder-y as her.... CHEF KISS!!! They're really meant to be. Both love pain kink, knife play, blood play, every single thing they love the other one also loves. So it's a match made in heaven... or Hell? *wink* Zane is a demon who has been following Juniper for years, making every single being know that she belongs to him. We do have a boy obsess with the heroine trope and it's so beautiful to see you don't even know.<br /><br /><b>What more can you find in this book?</b><br />♡ She stabs him, he gets hard!<br />♡ So much blood play you don't even know BLOODY KISSES<br />♡ They have the same chaotic energy<br />♡ Nasty, dirty, naughty public sex everywhere they go<br /><br />Please read TW before reading, there are many things that might be triggering to readers.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">24 likes</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19