mportant things in romance and i have a lot of respect for them. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis story is told mostly at the same time as book one, just with two side characters from that book, and i feel like stories like that never really work the best for me. Even though this completely stands on its own, and has its own very different plot points and points of view of what is going on during this time! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAgain, just the themes of reclaiming and healing from your trauma in different ways is really powerful and i can’t wait to read everything from this author. \u0026lt;3\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eContent Warnings from the author:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis book contains sexual scenes, kink/fetish content, horror elements, drug use, scenes of trauma, anxiety, and PTSD, and depictions of \"hard\" kink/edgeplay.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eother cw/tw i found while reading:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMurder, death, cult depiction, a lot of blood depiction, a lot of bad parenting in the past with abandonment and neglect, panic attacks, loss of a loved one, human sacrifice, use of plan b, hospital settings in the past, talk of medical debt, talk of needles, unwanted touching, assault, talk of cannibalism, torture, drugging, vomiting, and grief and depression depiction.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003ei also highly recommend \u003ca href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4765324578\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003emy friend leigh's review\u003c/a\u003e for trigger and content warnings! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://meltotheany.wordpress.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eBlog\u003c/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/meltotheany/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/jtotheimin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eYoutube\u003c/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"https://ko-fi.com/meltotheany\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eKo-fi\u003c/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"https://open.spotify.com/user/meltotheany?si=kHJ5JnLHQsSp23fDe0qxSQ\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eSpotify\u003c/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"http://www.twitch.tv/meltotheany\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eTwitch\u003c/a\u003e","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3EJICM31LJX44\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HAb8vYyZpBmDQGSp\"}}"},"likeCount":110,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":4},"User:7215885":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":7215885,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1630275217i/7215885._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1026,"textReviewsCount":986,"name":"Crystal ","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/7215885-crystal","contributor":null,"id":7215885},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1OD0Q29PO9XGD":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1OD0Q29PO9XGD"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1OD0Q29PO9XGD\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HAb8vYyZpBmDQGSp\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1OD0Q29PO9XGD","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1OD0Q29PO9XGD"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HAb8vYyZpBmDQGSp","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HAb8vYyZpBmDQGSp"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/7215885?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4248687751"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.gRvBER7tr8O1nmKWO7Q4yg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.gRvBER7tr8O1nmKWO7Q4yg","creator":{"__ref":"User:7215885"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1781821664526,"createdAt":1634790916327,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1635577242195,"text":"For The Love of Lucifer Five Stars (If I could give more, I would) \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHer Soul For Revenge is a masterpiece. Mic drop, the author rough her A-game and killed it!!! Her Soul To Take Should be read first, as this book runs along the same timeline, and you will have a better understanding of events. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e As much as this book is one of my most anticipated books of the year for me, I was worried about it being around the same timeline, details would be left out or changed. Rest assured, I should have known better with the author. She went into such great detail and didn’t change a thing. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe book starts with Juniper six years before the present, and what an intense start. Luckily, she survived and ran, only to return and seek revenge on those who wronged her and her family. Leon stalks Juniper for years, eagerly waiting for that moment to make a deal for her soul. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e “A good hunter tracks his prey,” I said, “and waits for just the right moment to take his prize\u003cbr /\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cp\u003e Never underestimate our girl Juniper, she is strong, sassy, puts up with nothing, and is murderous. She has been in survival mode for years and going from place to place. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eZane is everything, (sorry Leon) he is a hot, cocky, smooth talker, sadomasochistic, and just met his match. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e “I haven’t even begun to wreck you, girl. You think you won this round? You’ve only made me crave breaking you more.” She grinned, flipping me off from the floor. “I’ve already wrecked you, demon boy. Round one goes to me.”  \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e The chemistry between Zane and Juniper is explosive. It made all my lady parts tingle. (I will have to take that out for a retail review). Like I wanted a cigarette after they had sex or been a fly on the wall. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e Go on and bite me,” he growled. “Fucking bite me like you mean it.” God, his words got me hot. I bit down, hard, hard enough to have broken a mortal man’s fingers. But it only made Zane more vicious, it made him groan in pleasure as he fucked into me at a punishing pace.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e This book is intense, wicked, dark, and what a wild ride. I had to brace myself a time to two. It’s well written, I have said this before, and It still holds true, what a vivid Imagination that the author articulates flawless through her writing. I love it when I can picture a whole world in front of me. We also have a glimpse of Everely and the \u003cbr /\u003eperfect handoff to her book. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIf you haven’t started this series and love spicy dark PNR, what are you waiting for? I highly recommend it.\u003c/p\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1OD0Q29PO9XGD\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HAb8vYyZpBmDQGSp\"}}"},"likeCount":90,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":2},"User:97680258":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":97680258,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1776205849i/97680258._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":140,"textReviewsCount":240,"name":"earth to vivie' ","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/97680258-earth-to-vivie","contributor":null,"id":97680258},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1T8XQ64ONSMRP":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1T8XQ64ONSMRP"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1T8XQ64ONSMRP\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HAb8vYyZpBmDQGS