003cbr /\u003eIn Her Soul For Revenge it’s the survivor Juniper and her journey for revenge the reader follows. She sells her soul to the demon Zane for the purpose of him helping her getting revenge over those people who’s wronged her. \u003cbr /\u003eThere’s a price for making a deal with a demon and Zane has his conditions. He and Juniper were so much fun. Blazing hot chemistry and spectacular sex scenes. I thought the ones in book 1 were amazing but Laroux takes it up a notch. Chef’s kiss! They suited Juniper and Zane’s personality and they had to be dark, bloody and intense. Most important they’re consensual.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHer Soul For Revenge is a dark paranormal romance and it’s definitely dark but it’s also emotional. Laroux strips the layers of Juniper and Zane meticulously. Juniper is broken and has endured so much loss and pain. She’s a survivor and a fighter. Living a solitary life until her deal with Zane. Her progress and evolution was sublimely written. How can a demon be vulnerable and show emotions? Zane can and do thanks to Laroux. Zane goes through a change too and I enjoyed his sarcastic remarks, dark dominant side but also him being vulnerable and turning the power over to Juniper in their relationship. These two opposites truly saw each other, was accepting and it was beautiful.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWith Her Soul For Revenge I can already say that The Souls trilogy is a favorite of mine. \u003cbr /\u003eThis is just dark paranormal romance to perfection. Phenomenal. Whenever I hear the word demon I will always think of a forked pierced tongue. No complaints here.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e5 Fierce as a Little Wolf Stars\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e*ARC provided by the author*","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3AAKNS3JAY5A4\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HAb8vYyZpBmDQGSp\"}}"},"likeCount":36,"v