only like two fucks to give (one for leon, one for her). \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003ei am absolutely loving this plot. the ongoing story and the timeline and how everything is working. i am itching for the last book to find out what the fuck happens but also i don’t want it to end. also just wtf is gonna happen. this is such a great series. the relationship dynamics are clearly very different but i honestly loved this book just as much as the second. i couldn’t pick a favourite and rated the same. just so good. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e”Fix you? Ah, little wolf, I have no desire to fix you. I just want to see all your broken edges shine. I want to feel how sharp you are.”\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e“I didn't need a rescuer, I didn't need a guardian; he wasn't that. He was my comfort.”\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e“I slaughtered them all, Juniper. Every single one. I promise you right now that nothing that dares try to hurt you gets to live. Nothing.”\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e• paranormal romance\u003cbr /\u003e• human x demon \u003cbr /\u003e• revenge plot\u003cbr /\u003e• age gap 😈\u003cbr /\u003e• sadomasochism \u003cbr /\u003e• exhibitionism / voyeurism\u003cbr /\u003e• bdsm\u003c/i\u003e","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2JNSX1FOFQ0QG\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HAb8vYyZpBmDQGSp\"}}"},"likeCount":26,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":2},"User:4216651":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":4216651,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1673105005i/4216651._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":3182,"textReviewsCount":1424,"name":"sil ♡ the book voyagers","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/4216651-sil-the-book-voyagers","contributor":null,"id":4216651},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AX6CDU6UNPY0G":{"__typename":"User"