evenge.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRevenge, pain, survival— they're all the roots of this novel. They rule Juniper's life in a way that she sees nothing aside from them. She doesn't care about anything but revenge and her anger. And I wanted that for her. I wanted to get everything she wanted in the world, I wanted her to murder everyone who wronged her and who hurt her and who tried to eliminate her. Juniper is a force to be reckoned with!!!! I loved her with my whole heart and I love more her murder-y ways. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBut the way she finds her other half in someone just as murder-y as her.... CHEF KISS!!! They're really meant to be. Both love pain kink, knife play, blood play, every single thing they love the other one also loves. So it's a match made in heaven... or Hell? *wink* Zane is a demon who has been following Juniper for years, making every single being know that she belongs to him. We do have a boy obsess with the heroine trope and it's so beautiful to see you don't even know.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhat more can you find in this book?\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e♡ She stabs him, he gets hard!\u003cbr /\u003e♡ So much blood play you don't even know BLOODY KISSES\u003cbr /\u003e♡ They have the same chaotic energy\u003cbr /\u003e♡ Nasty, dirty, naughty public sex everywhere they go\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003ePlease read TW before reading, there are many things that might be triggering to readers.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AX6CDU6UNPY0G\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HAb8vYyZpBmDQGSp\"}}"},"likeCount":24,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:73275415":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":73275415,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1618266546i/73275415._UX200_CR0,25,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":